Package: ndm
Title: Neural Disease Modeling Software
Version: 0.0.1
Author: Connor T. Jerzak [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Connor T. Jerzak <connor.jerzak@austin.utexas.edu>
Authors@R: 
    person(given = c("Connor", "T."),
           family = "Jerzak",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "connor.jerzak@austin.utexas.edu")
Description: Provides an R-first interface for neural disease modeling with a
    reticulate-managed JAX backend. The package includes backend bootstrap
    helpers, built-in epidemiological model specifications, TFRecord-consuming
    data interfaces, and a vendored runtime bundle for running extracted model
    build and training code entirely from within the package.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: data.table, rlang, reticulate, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
